/P 129 0 R
/E (Managing personal health records manually is difficult and time-consuming. Important medical information can be lost, misplaced, or not available when needed. This creates problems in emergencies and affects proper treatment. Therefore, there is a need for a system that can store and manage health records safely and easily.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
